  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to NRB on devolution program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will support Pakistan&apos;s devolution initiative by funding local and foreign consultants and associated costs to provide technical inputs and advice, incorporate lessons from international experience, and help with design of selected parts of the devolution program. Assistance will be provided to the National Reconstruction Bureau (NRB), the agency responsible for designing and planning the devolution initiative, in response to NRB&apos;s request for World Bank cooperation and support.  The main objective of this task is to help ensure thatr Pakistan&apos;s  ambitious devolution plan ---- whose fundamental objectives are to strengthen accountability, improve service delivery, and empower the population at the local level-- is well-designed and workable and can be effectively implemented on a sustainable basis. A second strategic objective is to strengthen NRB&apos;s technical capacity to assess and analyze key issues related to devolution and to effectively supervise and assess the work done by other agencies and consultants on devolution.</narrative>
  </description>
